## **1. Overview**

The **Lilly Digital Wallet (LDW)** is an established component designed to enable patient enrollment, copay card generation, and digital wallet management for various clinical programs. It integrates with internal systems and external APIs to provide a seamless patient experience and support for operational teams.

The solution leverages modular design principles, scalable architecture, and secure integration patterns to ensure data integrity, compliance, and maintainability.

